<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Finney Incorporated — Fictional Exercise Document — accessible alternative</title>
  <style>body{font:18px/1.6 Georgia,serif;max-width:72ch;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem;color:#171717;background:#fff}h1,h2{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.2}.notice{border-left:.35rem solid #24557a;padding:.75rem 1rem;background:#eef6fb}a:focus{outline:3px solid #c45500;outline-offset:3px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f5f5f5;background:#171717}.notice{background:#163247}}</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Finney Incorporated — Fictional Exercise Document</h1>
    <p class="notice"><strong>Training notice:</strong> Fictional exercise document — not for operational use</p>
    <section aria-labelledby="s1"><h2 id="s1">Lease summary</h2><p>Five-year office lease commencing January 1, 2026.</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="s2"><h2 id="s2">Commercial terms</h2><p>Base rent is $18,000 per month for year 1, increasing 3% each January. Two months are rent-free. Security deposit is $36,000.</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="s3"><h2 id="s3">Options and costs</h2><p>A three-year renewal option is available at market rent. Finney Incorporated paid $24,000 in initial direct commissions. The agreement states no implicit interest rate.</p></section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
